rreaction and the bad policy.\n\nIt means a lot of people died, a lot are terribly injured, and more will die.  It means that a lot of our youngsters will have fertility problems.\n\nThat doctor jumped up and down and screamed and a bunch of assholes chose to ignore her, and our families, including mine, have and will pay a macabre price.\n\nNobody wanted to be as right about this as we are.  We were hoping to be at least a little bit wrong.  ", "author": "Belleoffreedom", "created": 1786506235685, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Mintap", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "It gives me no pleasure to be right about Fauci, COVID, and now other vaccines.", "last_comment_created": 1786511477620, "content": "<p>I saw some asshole chide one of our outlier clinicians, accusing her of bragging about being right.  Said she was annoying.  The dumbass has no idea of what it means to be right about the COVID debacle, its technology, its effects and defects, the overreaction and the bad policy.</p>\n<p>It means a lot of people died, a lot are terribly injured, and more will die.  It means that a lot of our youngsters will have fertility problems.</p>\n<p>That doctor jumped up and down and screamed and a bunch of assholes chose to ignore her, and our families, including mine, have and will pay a macabre price.</p>\n<p>Nobody wanted to be as right about this as we are.  We were hoping to be at least a little bit wrong.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 3, "score_up": 52, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"statu